WEBVTT

00:00:01.350 --> 00:00:03.750
You mean to say that the one caught was not Chiyo-dono?

00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:07.270
Yeah. That voice was definitely Anzu's.

00:00:07.270 --> 00:00:09.670
Anzu's the one the
vice president caught.

00:00:10.220 --> 00:00:12.100
Why would Anzu-san be...?

00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:15.260
Are we sure she's not just helping the Underground Student Council with another plot?

00:00:15.260 --> 00:00:19.710
No, if she were working with them, the
vice president wouldn't have apprehended her!

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:22.510
Rather, I believe the
exact opposite occurred.

00:00:22.850 --> 00:00:24.670
So in other words, Anzu was...

00:00:24.670 --> 00:00:26.760
here to help us?!

00:00:26.760 --> 00:00:27.640
Spit it out, Anzu!

00:00:27.640 --> 00:00:29.440
What were you doing over there?!

00:00:31.580 --> 00:00:33.620
Hmph, not talking, huh?

00:00:33.620 --> 00:00:35.570
You'll start talking soon enough.

00:00:43.070 --> 00:00:45.040
Still don't feel like talking?

00:00:45.450 --> 00:00:46.720
This is for the best.

00:00:46.720 --> 00:00:50.080
I was so blinded by getting an executive position in the Underground Student Council next term

00:00:50.430 --> 00:00:52.270
that I set up Shingo in that trap.

00:00:52.270 --> 00:00:54.080
It's my fault.

00:02:34.430 --> 00:02:35.650
Too long.

00:02:35.650 --> 00:02:36.690
And Hana-san isn't moving.

00:02:36.970 --> 00:02:38.890
How long are we going to stay like this?

00:02:38.890 --> 00:02:39.940
I'm out of breath.

00:02:40.410 --> 00:02:42.450
But if I breathe, I'll snort.

00:02:47.370 --> 00:02:49.830
Hana-san was holding her breath, too?

00:02:52.960 --> 00:02:55.250
Please stop! That's enough, isn't it?!

00:02:55.580 --> 00:02:57.030
No, not yet.

00:02:57.030 --> 00:02:58.000
Why not?

00:02:58.000 --> 00:03:01.090
You've already taken my first kiss. Isn't that enough already?!

00:03:01.090 --> 00:03:03.100
No! I haven't seen you pee yet!

00:03:03.100 --> 00:03:04.400
I can't pee!

00:03:04.400 --> 00:03:06.670
I'm the hardest I've ever been
in my life! It's not happening!

00:03:06.670 --> 00:03:08.090
Then let me kiss you instead!

00:03:08.090 --> 00:03:08.640
No!

00:03:12.540 --> 00:03:14.360
What was that just now? A signal?

00:03:14.360 --> 00:03:18.150
It said on the note to not go into the
Corrections Office until the lights go out, though.

00:03:18.150 --> 00:03:20.040
If you don't kiss me...

00:03:20.040 --> 00:03:25.080
I'll tell Chiyo-chan that <i>I</i> was your first kiss, and not her, you idiotic Kiyoshi.

00:03:26.540 --> 00:03:27.320
Chiyo-chan...

00:03:27.660 --> 00:03:28.530
I'm sorry!

00:03:29.080 --> 00:03:31.290
I wonder if I should just wait here.

00:03:31.700 --> 00:03:33.870
What could be going on in there?

00:03:34.280 --> 00:03:38.210
I would venture that Anzu-dono has become our ally.

00:03:38.620 --> 00:03:42.730
She <i>did</i> end up drawing the vice
president away from the prison.

00:03:42.730 --> 00:03:43.950
And thanks to that,

00:03:43.950 --> 00:03:46.340
Chiyo-chan can sneak
in more easily now.

00:03:46.600 --> 00:03:48.460
Anzu, thank you.

00:03:48.460 --> 00:03:51.410
I swear, we will overturn our expulsions!

00:03:51.410 --> 00:03:54.860
All we can do now is wait and have faith in Kiyoshi-dono,

00:03:54.860 --> 00:03:57.150
who suffers at the hands of Hana-dono.

00:03:57.150 --> 00:03:59.370
Something's not right.

00:03:59.370 --> 00:04:01.190
Why is Hana-san so rigid?

00:04:01.630 --> 00:04:03.560
Is this what a kiss is
supposed to be like?

00:04:03.560 --> 00:04:04.760
No, it's not!

00:04:04.760 --> 00:04:07.360
From what I know, a kiss should be more active!

00:04:07.360 --> 00:04:10.280
Lips ravenously melded together, sucking on each other,

00:04:10.280 --> 00:04:12.410
tongues entwined, and licking all around!

00:04:12.410 --> 00:04:14.140
This is not a real kiss!

00:04:14.140 --> 00:04:15.450
It's a child's kiss!

00:04:15.920 --> 00:04:19.550
Chiyo-chan, I haven't had my first kiss yet!

00:04:19.550 --> 00:04:23.390
This isn't an actual kiss after all,
it's just a child's kiss!

00:04:23.390 --> 00:04:25.960
My body is still pure!

00:04:26.470 --> 00:04:29.020
But forgive me, Chiyo-chan.

00:04:29.020 --> 00:04:32.050
There's something more important than my first kiss right now!

00:04:32.460 --> 00:04:35.390
My promise to my friends
to overturn our expulsions!

00:04:38.610 --> 00:04:41.730
Wh-Wh-What the...?

00:04:41.730 --> 00:04:42.520
Wh-Wh-Wh—

00:04:43.570 --> 00:04:44.570
What's he doing?!

00:04:44.570 --> 00:04:45.360
I knew it.

00:04:45.700 --> 00:04:47.860
Hana-san is nothing
but an innocent child.

00:04:48.180 --> 00:04:49.820
You have to give
an inch to get a mile!

00:04:50.280 --> 00:04:51.980
You can have my first kiss!

00:04:51.980 --> 00:04:54.290
In return, I will<i> overturn our expulsions!</i>

00:04:56.780 --> 00:04:58.120
It's so quiet.

00:04:58.650 --> 00:05:01.130
I wonder if anyone is in there anymore.

00:05:01.130 --> 00:05:02.390
What is this?

00:05:02.390 --> 00:05:04.380
What?! What?!
Why is his tongue in there?!

00:05:04.380 --> 00:05:07.420
Ah, my head is spinning,
and I feel numb...

00:05:07.850 --> 00:05:12.600
My head is... g-g-getting loopy!

00:05:18.490 --> 00:05:21.490
Shimazu Yoshihiro was a major figure in the Sengoku period,

00:05:21.490 --> 00:05:24.000
the head of the Shimazu clan,
which occupied southern Kyushu,

00:05:24.000 --> 00:05:26.570
and was centered around Satsuma.

00:05:28.420 --> 00:05:29.970
What's the matter, Gakuto?

00:05:29.970 --> 00:05:34.240
Oh, for some reason, a memory of
Kiyoshi-dono just crossed my mind.

00:05:34.240 --> 00:05:37.080
Tell us, what are you babbling on about?

00:05:37.850 --> 00:05:40.700
It was a balmy, mirthful day,

00:05:40.700 --> 00:05:43.430
and we were enjoying
a conversation together.

00:05:43.430 --> 00:05:45.350
Woe, troubled times, troubled times!

00:05:45.350 --> 00:05:47.670
It was September 15, 5th year of the Keicho era.

00:05:47.670 --> 00:05:49.780
During the decisive Battle of
Sekigahara, the Western Army,

00:05:49.780 --> 00:05:52.330
with which the Shimazu clan were aligned, were nearing defeat.

00:05:52.330 --> 00:05:54.820
The Shimazu forces were isolated, surrounded by the enemy, their escape route cut off.

00:05:54.820 --> 00:05:57.210
It looked as though their annihilation was only a matter of time.

00:05:57.210 --> 00:05:59.680
However, Shimazu Yoshihiro struck
through the center of the enemy line!

00:06:00.060 --> 00:06:05.180
Yoshihiro ordered his own men to charge at the vast army that was closing in from the fore!

00:06:05.180 --> 00:06:08.800
It was through that desperate act that he
succeeded in carving out a path of retreat.

00:06:08.800 --> 00:06:12.170
Ever after, this unprecedented withdrawal would be spoken of

00:06:12.170 --> 00:06:14.560
as the "Flight of Shimazu."

00:06:14.560 --> 00:06:17.840
Hmm... So anyway, who do you like in MomoKuro?

00:06:17.840 --> 00:06:19.920
Yours truly is not up
to date on idol groups.

00:06:19.920 --> 00:06:22.160
Three Kingdoms or Sengoku-era generals, on the other hand...

00:06:22.160 --> 00:06:24.360
It is a curious thing, is it not?

00:06:24.360 --> 00:06:27.730
Remembering something that happened so recently like it was so long ago?

00:06:27.730 --> 00:06:30.480
That's just a story about you talking to yourself, isn't it?

00:06:30.480 --> 00:06:33.040
Don't be absurd! It is a shared memory!

00:06:33.040 --> 00:06:35.250
Yeah, and you were
grinning about it so hard!

00:06:35.250 --> 00:06:36.720
What part of that story is supposed to be funny?!

00:06:36.720 --> 00:06:39.010
It wasn't a very touching
friendship episode.

00:06:39.010 --> 00:06:40.410
I regret listening.

00:06:40.410 --> 00:06:45.230
Then again, we're right in the middle of one of those cut-off-from-retreat situations, right?

00:06:45.230 --> 00:06:46.660
You are exactly right!

00:06:46.660 --> 00:06:48.860
<i>That</i> is what yours truly is trying to say!

00:06:49.130 --> 00:06:54.220
Kiyoshi-dono, yours truly can nary imagine your current plight, but give it your best effort!

00:06:54.220 --> 00:06:58.280
You may just be fighting your own "Battle of Sekigahara" in there!

00:06:58.500 --> 00:07:00.120
Charge the center of the enemy's line!

00:07:00.660 --> 00:07:02.910
I will not retreat to the rear! Forward!

00:07:02.910 --> 00:07:05.880
I will move forward and break out of this predicament!

00:07:05.880 --> 00:07:08.730
Flight... I can't remember
where I heard of it,

00:07:08.730 --> 00:07:11.960
but this deep kiss is going to be my own "Flight of Shimazu"!

00:07:27.380 --> 00:07:28.940
Kiyoshi-kun...

00:07:28.940 --> 00:07:29.760
is alone?

00:07:32.020 --> 00:07:32.980
I won.

00:07:34.130 --> 00:07:36.110
It was a hard-fought battle.

00:07:37.700 --> 00:07:38.520
Chiyo-chan?!

00:07:38.520 --> 00:07:40.620
I told her to wait until
the lights were out!

00:07:40.620 --> 00:07:42.180
If we're seen from the
angle of that door,

00:07:42.180 --> 00:07:44.410
then this plan is screwed before it has a chance to succeed!

00:07:44.410 --> 00:07:47.250
If the door is unlocked, it means to come in, right?

00:07:47.250 --> 00:07:48.440
I'm screwed, I'm screwed, I'm screwed!

00:07:48.440 --> 00:07:49.000
Underpants!

00:07:49.000 --> 00:07:49.670
There's no time!

00:07:49.670 --> 00:07:51.380
What do I do? I can't think!
It's no use! She'll see!

00:07:51.380 --> 00:07:52.960
Not yet!

00:07:52.960 --> 00:07:54.440
We're just getting started!

00:07:54.440 --> 00:07:56.370
It's too soon, too soon!

00:07:56.370 --> 00:07:57.950
Enough. I'm leaving.

00:07:57.950 --> 00:07:58.840
Huh?

00:07:58.840 --> 00:08:00.010
I'm going home.

00:08:00.010 --> 00:08:01.780
Uh, just a moment, Hana-san.

00:08:01.780 --> 00:08:03.780
You forgot your panties and leggings.

00:08:03.780 --> 00:08:05.940
That's okay. I'm going home now.

00:08:05.940 --> 00:08:07.190
No, but you can't.

00:08:07.880 --> 00:08:09.290
Huh? Lights out.

00:08:09.290 --> 00:08:11.730
I guess I really was being too hasty.

00:08:13.940 --> 00:08:17.030
Anzu, you didn't talk to the very end.

00:08:17.300 --> 00:08:20.740
Could you really have just been out for an evening stroll?

00:08:21.400 --> 00:08:22.440
It's strange.

00:08:23.380 --> 00:08:25.170
Something feels out of place.

00:08:28.750 --> 00:08:30.040
What could this be?

00:08:30.040 --> 00:08:32.230
A message from Kiyoshi-kun?

00:08:32.950 --> 00:08:34.210
It's kind of warm.

00:08:36.480 --> 00:08:39.550
Hana-san's acting completely different from earlier.

00:08:39.550 --> 00:08:43.060
I'll bet that really was Hana-san's first kiss, after all, huh?

00:08:43.060 --> 00:08:46.480
Whether for revenge or not,
was it okay for me to take her first kiss?

00:08:46.480 --> 00:08:49.020
I'm not sure. I kind
of feel bad about this.

00:08:52.080 --> 00:08:53.230
Get in.

00:08:53.990 --> 00:08:56.150
What the hell happened in the Corrections Office?

00:08:56.840 --> 00:08:58.740
The first step of the plan was successful.

00:08:58.740 --> 00:08:59.780
Kiyoshi-dono!

00:09:00.100 --> 00:09:02.440
Even while enduring the retaliation of the fearsome Hana-dono,

00:09:02.440 --> 00:09:05.120
he was still able to safely accomplish his mission!

00:09:05.690 --> 00:09:08.160
Okay, study on your own until bedtime.

00:09:08.160 --> 00:09:10.240
Ah, I request permission
to use the lavatory.

00:09:10.240 --> 00:09:11.300
Me, too.

00:09:11.300 --> 00:09:13.590
Tsk, make it quick.

00:09:14.310 --> 00:09:17.070
What exactly are you
doing, Vice President?

00:09:17.070 --> 00:09:18.880
President, I was...

00:09:18.880 --> 00:09:20.050
I see.

00:09:20.700 --> 00:09:22.740
Anzu was acting suspiciously?

00:09:22.740 --> 00:09:23.300
Yes.

00:09:23.300 --> 00:09:27.010
I applied intensive interrogation methods, but she gave nothing up.

00:09:27.450 --> 00:09:28.980
Anzu may not be connected,

00:09:28.980 --> 00:09:31.720
and they may have given up, unable to do anything.

00:09:31.720 --> 00:09:33.960
You've worked up quite a sweat again.

00:09:34.520 --> 00:09:36.420
If you're hot, why don't you change?

00:09:36.420 --> 00:09:36.980
Yes.

00:09:44.780 --> 00:09:47.490
"All prisoners are in their cells,

00:09:47.760 --> 00:09:49.230
and the doors are locked.

00:09:49.690 --> 00:09:52.690
Nothing out of the ordinary here, so I'm going to bed."

00:09:52.690 --> 00:09:54.160
That's the report from Hana.

00:09:54.660 --> 00:09:56.670
Maybe there really
isn't anything going on...

00:09:57.030 --> 00:09:57.860
Perhaps.

00:09:58.600 --> 00:10:00.720
But there's still a sense
of unease, isn't there?

00:10:00.720 --> 00:10:04.270
Yes. Actually, something
is bothering me, too,

00:10:04.270 --> 00:10:05.470
but I'm not sure what.

00:10:06.560 --> 00:10:10.560
From what you have told me, it concerns me that Anzu was so easily caught.

00:10:11.320 --> 00:10:13.680
While she was making a fuss,

00:10:13.680 --> 00:10:16.570
the boys must have been up to something inside.

00:10:17.780 --> 00:10:18.610
They couldn't have been!

00:10:22.030 --> 00:10:23.160
What is it?

00:10:23.160 --> 00:10:25.870
Thank you... for the... whipping...

00:10:27.160 --> 00:10:30.360
They're all here. They're behind two locked doors.

00:10:30.360 --> 00:10:32.470
I don't see how it's possible for them to get out.

00:10:32.470 --> 00:10:34.760
You're sweating like crazy.

00:10:34.760 --> 00:10:36.560
Shouldn't you have changed first?

00:10:36.560 --> 00:10:37.800
Oh, no, I'm all right.

00:10:37.800 --> 00:10:38.530
Okay.

00:10:39.010 --> 00:10:41.380
Then, why don't we go
check the other rooms?

00:10:41.830 --> 00:10:43.800
I will go check on the
Corrections Office.

00:10:43.800 --> 00:10:45.010
Vice President, you have the restroom.

00:10:49.660 --> 00:10:51.240
Nothing out of place here.

00:10:55.310 --> 00:10:57.730
Oh, no! My bladder is near its limit!

00:10:58.060 --> 00:10:59.960
Damn it, why won't this open?!

00:10:59.960 --> 00:11:01.190
If I don't do something,

00:11:01.190 --> 00:11:03.610
I'll be the same as that pants-crapping four-eyes!

00:11:03.860 --> 00:11:05.680
What is this for?

00:11:07.220 --> 00:11:08.780
Vice President, what's wrong?!

00:11:09.700 --> 00:11:11.910
Vice President, what is it?!

00:11:12.250 --> 00:11:13.580
I'm terribly sorry.

00:11:13.580 --> 00:11:15.900
I was just using the restroom...

00:11:15.900 --> 00:11:18.520
and I couldn't quite
get out of my clothes...

00:11:18.520 --> 00:11:20.040
and so I inadvertently cried out.

00:11:20.040 --> 00:11:23.210
Please rest at ease, nothing out
of the ordinary in the restroom.

00:11:26.520 --> 00:11:28.910
Nothing could be going on.

00:11:28.910 --> 00:11:31.100
No, of course not.

00:11:31.920 --> 00:11:34.890
This is an inescapable prison, after all.

00:11:35.460 --> 00:11:39.180
Those scum have no other
recourse but to be expelled.

00:11:53.630 --> 00:11:57.040
Tomorrow at last is the day of...

00:11:57.040 --> 00:11:57.690
reckoning...

00:11:58.300 --> 00:12:00.400
The boys and the Underground Student Council.

00:12:00.400 --> 00:12:03.590
No matter which side wins,
it will be tough to bring down...

00:12:04.330 --> 00:12:05.260
judgement.

00:12:20.170 --> 00:12:22.780
So this is my last day with these guys.

00:12:26.610 --> 00:12:28.980
Good morning, gentlemen.

00:12:28.980 --> 00:12:30.410
I hope you slept...

00:12:31.160 --> 00:12:32.200
well.

00:12:32.200 --> 00:12:34.220
The crimes you have committed

00:12:34.220 --> 00:12:36.070
include peeking into the girls' baths,

00:12:36.070 --> 00:12:40.250
and breaking out three times of the prison in which you were confined.

00:12:40.250 --> 00:12:42.460
Do you dispute either of these...

00:12:42.750 --> 00:12:43.380
facts?

00:12:44.900 --> 00:12:46.720
There are no objections...

00:12:46.720 --> 00:12:47.670
then?

00:12:47.670 --> 00:12:49.650
Not even the slightest
plea for an appeal.

00:12:49.650 --> 00:12:50.590
Of course not.

00:12:51.180 --> 00:12:53.310
So what is this sense of unease I feel?

00:12:56.760 --> 00:12:58.760
...that's what I thought, but then—

00:13:01.260 --> 00:13:04.730
You are scheduled to be expelled...

00:13:04.730 --> 00:13:05.640
today.

00:13:05.640 --> 00:13:07.300
Do you have anything to say?

00:13:08.990 --> 00:13:10.830
What a disgrace.

00:13:10.830 --> 00:13:14.620
After all, there is no place for <i>scum</i> like you at this school!

00:13:14.900 --> 00:13:18.240
What is it? Something just isn't sitting right with me.

00:13:19.950 --> 00:13:21.380
Stay away!

00:13:21.880 --> 00:13:23.020
Prowler!

00:13:23.020 --> 00:13:24.780
Someone catch him!

00:13:27.320 --> 00:13:28.570
You sicko!

00:13:30.430 --> 00:13:32.560
You all have lost.

00:13:32.560 --> 00:13:34.930
Please remove yourself from the school at once!

00:13:36.810 --> 00:13:37.720
You're wrong.

00:13:39.590 --> 00:13:41.310
I beg your pardon, President,

00:13:42.160 --> 00:13:43.610
but <i>we're</i> the ones who've won.

00:13:45.770 --> 00:13:47.190
What are you trying
to pull now of all times?

00:13:47.850 --> 00:13:50.150
It sounds to me like the desperate whining of the defeated.

00:13:51.400 --> 00:13:52.610
No...

00:13:53.120 --> 00:13:54.020
It can't be...

00:13:57.240 --> 00:13:58.370
Who are you?!

00:14:00.970 --> 00:14:02.960
Please let me go, Vice President.

00:14:03.880 --> 00:14:04.670
Joe!

00:14:04.670 --> 00:14:06.210
Then, who are you?!

00:14:08.140 --> 00:14:10.590
Why?! What is the
meaning of this, Chiyo?!

00:14:11.960 --> 00:14:14.090
This<i> is what was nagging at me!</i>

00:14:14.090 --> 00:14:16.980
Why didn't I realize that
Gakuto's height was different?

00:14:16.980 --> 00:14:19.850
And that last night, Gakuto went to sleep with his glasses on?!

00:14:19.850 --> 00:14:22.100
Then where's Gakuto? Where is Dirty Four-eyes?!

00:14:22.100 --> 00:14:24.980
This way! The president and the others are this way!

00:14:25.250 --> 00:14:26.940
When Gakuto makes his appearance,

00:14:27.320 --> 00:14:31.240
this time, it will mean the end for
the Underground Student Council.

00:14:31.630 --> 00:14:33.700
We've won, President!

00:14:34.320 --> 00:14:36.830
That's right. Gakuto is our final trump card!

00:14:36.830 --> 00:14:38.870
President! We caught a molester!

00:14:38.870 --> 00:14:39.830
You misunderstand!

00:14:42.620 --> 00:14:44.000
Ladies and gentlemen,

00:14:44.000 --> 00:14:45.880
sorry to keep you waiting.

00:14:46.460 --> 00:14:49.300
I, the most resourceful strategist of the modern age,

00:14:49.900 --> 00:14:52.760
and author of today's plot,
Morokuzu Takehito, have arri—

00:14:52.760 --> 00:14:54.260
What are you trying to look
like a hero for, you sicko?!

00:14:54.260 --> 00:14:55.880
Running around in nothing but
your underpants is really gross!

00:14:55.880 --> 00:14:56.680
Enough!

00:14:56.680 --> 00:14:58.470
You girls return to...

00:14:59.020 --> 00:14:59.560
class!

00:14:59.560 --> 00:15:00.910
Okay.

00:15:01.390 --> 00:15:03.810
Gakuto, why are you in your underpants?

00:15:03.810 --> 00:15:05.440
You had Chiyo-chan's
gym clothes, didn't you?

00:15:05.940 --> 00:15:09.100
Chiyo-dono's gym clothes could not very well be sullied

00:15:09.100 --> 00:15:10.940
by a britches-besmircher
such as yours truly.

00:15:11.560 --> 00:15:13.880
Chiyo-dono is not only
beautiful and brave,

00:15:13.880 --> 00:15:19.080
she is truly a righteous girl, who took pity on our plight, and helped us to implement this plan!

00:15:19.080 --> 00:15:22.490
Chiyo, how did you...
When did you get inside the prison?

00:15:22.490 --> 00:15:25.410
Dirty Four-eyes! How did you get out of your cell?!

00:15:25.410 --> 00:15:27.690
I made sure to lock
you into it last night!

00:15:28.130 --> 00:15:30.130
It was a three-way exchange.

00:15:30.430 --> 00:15:32.220
Three-way exchange?

00:15:32.220 --> 00:15:34.960
Last night, I snuck in through the Corrections Office's back door,

00:15:34.960 --> 00:15:36.260
and hid inside the restroom.

00:15:36.260 --> 00:15:39.360
No way! I know I locked that door... didn't I?

00:15:39.360 --> 00:15:41.220
No, it was open.

00:15:42.020 --> 00:15:46.810
After that, yours truly and Joe-dono went to the lavatory where Chiyo-dono was waiting.

00:15:47.560 --> 00:15:49.360
Chiyo-dono put on Joe-dono's clothes,

00:15:49.360 --> 00:15:50.860
and Joe-dono put on yours truly's clothes.

00:15:50.860 --> 00:15:52.690
Then yours truly went to the Corrections Office.

00:15:52.690 --> 00:15:55.950
Thus our three-way
exchange was complete!

00:15:55.950 --> 00:15:57.090
You mean...

00:15:57.090 --> 00:15:59.120
You're saying that cut
on your forehead was...?

00:15:59.120 --> 00:15:59.600
Yes.

00:15:59.600 --> 00:16:03.010
To make it easier to disguise Joe-dono, yours truly sustained that wound,

00:16:03.010 --> 00:16:04.830
and wrapped it up with a generous amount of bandages.

00:16:05.110 --> 00:16:06.110
Mr. Chairman,

00:16:06.110 --> 00:16:10.000
we will now reveal the misdeeds perpetrated by the Underground Student Council.

00:16:10.690 --> 00:16:16.550
The Underground Student Council set up a trap to have us boys kicked out of Hachimitsu Academy.

00:16:16.970 --> 00:16:20.470
Having Joe's ants attacked by crows, as well as Andre's breakout,

00:16:20.470 --> 00:16:22.010
and Shingo breaking his curfew,

00:16:22.010 --> 00:16:24.980
were all traps concocted by the Underground Student Council.

00:16:25.580 --> 00:16:27.270
It was their "Dog Transferal Operation!"

00:16:27.270 --> 00:16:29.550
Lies! They are making this up!

00:16:29.550 --> 00:16:31.020
There is no evidence of this anywhere!

00:16:31.250 --> 00:16:36.110
Why, because you erased the DTO
planning data from your computer?

00:16:36.450 --> 00:16:40.530
We weren't just playing hide-and-seek last night.

00:16:40.990 --> 00:16:45.540
Suppose that someone was able to recover the data from the computer in the Corrections Office.

00:16:45.540 --> 00:16:47.660
There's no way... you could have...

00:16:47.970 --> 00:16:48.830
That's right.

00:16:48.830 --> 00:16:53.210
Last night when we made our rounds,
the Corrections Office was locked up, and no one...

00:16:53.210 --> 00:16:54.990
<i>no one</i> was inside the office!

00:16:54.990 --> 00:16:56.300
I was outside.

00:16:56.600 --> 00:16:59.720
I locked the Corrections Office from the inside, left out the back door,

00:16:59.720 --> 00:17:02.050
and hid outside until morning.

00:17:02.820 --> 00:17:05.690
President, when you and the vice president made your rounds,

00:17:05.690 --> 00:17:08.310
our plan had already reached its fruition!

00:17:08.310 --> 00:17:09.270
You're bluffing!

00:17:09.270 --> 00:17:12.970
Only ten minutes passed from when we received Hana's message to when we entered the prison!

00:17:12.970 --> 00:17:15.400
How could you recover
the data so quickly?!

00:17:15.400 --> 00:17:18.030
We did not have a mere ten minutes to work with,

00:17:18.930 --> 00:17:20.410
we had twenty minutes!

00:17:21.000 --> 00:17:23.170
I downloaded the restoration software onto the PC

00:17:23.170 --> 00:17:25.140
in the Corrections Office ahead of time.

00:17:25.140 --> 00:17:26.240
Ahead of time?!

00:17:26.690 --> 00:17:27.250
Yes!

00:17:27.570 --> 00:17:29.750
Earlier, when the vice president was engaged in arm wrestling,

00:17:29.750 --> 00:17:34.560
yours truly made his way into the
Corrections Office for those ten minutes.

00:17:34.560 --> 00:17:35.670
You what...?

00:17:36.110 --> 00:17:38.420
Then, where is that data...

00:17:38.900 --> 00:17:40.130
now?

00:17:40.130 --> 00:17:41.510
The data...

00:17:43.240 --> 00:17:43.760
is right here.

00:17:45.180 --> 00:17:47.600
Please hold it fast, Mr. Chairman!

00:17:48.180 --> 00:17:49.470
You mean...

00:17:49.470 --> 00:17:49.940
<i>that</i>?

00:17:50.390 --> 00:17:51.290
This...

00:17:51.760 --> 00:17:55.890
Though we may have been born apart in time and place,

00:17:55.890 --> 00:17:57.570
we are of one heart,

00:17:58.480 --> 00:18:00.490
and this is the soul of the five of us,

00:18:01.130 --> 00:18:02.750
obtained at last...

00:18:05.110 --> 00:18:07.560
after overcoming many
trials and tribulations!

00:18:12.110 --> 00:18:13.460
This soul of men...

00:18:14.350 --> 00:18:15.630
is hereby received and held...

00:18:15.980 --> 00:18:16.880
fast!

00:18:25.630 --> 00:18:26.930
Indeed...

00:18:27.250 --> 00:18:30.640
The situations you boys experienced and what is written here

00:18:31.100 --> 00:18:33.300
are remarkably the...

00:18:33.300 --> 00:18:33.600
same.

00:18:37.650 --> 00:18:40.160
It's my... fault.

00:18:40.160 --> 00:18:40.880
Huh?

00:18:41.480 --> 00:18:44.410
The one who left the back door unlocked for Chiyo-chan...

00:18:44.700 --> 00:18:47.440
was you, wasn't it, Kiyoshi?

00:18:47.440 --> 00:18:48.400
Yes.

00:18:48.400 --> 00:18:52.080
When I made my move, and exploited the opening you gave me, Hana-san, I unlocked it.

00:18:52.460 --> 00:18:54.760
Opening, you say?

00:18:54.760 --> 00:18:56.170
That was just to trick me?

00:18:57.590 --> 00:18:58.530
Hana?

00:18:58.960 --> 00:19:01.300
That was just to distract me?

00:19:02.640 --> 00:19:03.510
I'm sorry.

00:19:04.970 --> 00:19:08.220
Damn you, Kiyoshi!

00:19:11.520 --> 00:19:12.490
Don't, Hana!

00:19:12.490 --> 00:19:12.980
Stop this!

00:19:12.980 --> 00:19:14.600
Kiyoshi, you bastard, I'm gonna kill you!

00:19:16.870 --> 00:19:17.360
President!

00:19:20.580 --> 00:19:22.150
That's enough, Hana.

00:19:23.090 --> 00:19:24.860
This isn't your fault.

00:19:25.630 --> 00:19:26.570
Nor yours, Meiko.

00:19:27.080 --> 00:19:30.840
I just forced you to
go along with my plans.

00:19:30.840 --> 00:19:31.500
No...

00:19:32.430 --> 00:19:33.880
I am truly sorry.

00:19:34.670 --> 00:19:36.460
This is all my fault.

00:19:38.690 --> 00:19:45.000
President, it is fair to say that this plot was the work of the Underground Student Council...

00:19:45.000 --> 00:19:45.830
isn't it?

00:19:46.500 --> 00:19:47.090
Yes.

00:19:48.300 --> 00:19:49.720
Very well.

00:19:50.410 --> 00:19:51.560
Onee-chan...

00:19:51.560 --> 00:19:54.570
My decision concerning your
actions will come at a later...

00:19:54.570 --> 00:19:55.580
date.

00:19:56.480 --> 00:19:57.400
Gentlemen,

00:19:57.770 --> 00:20:02.860
you were originally confined to the prison for the crime of peeking into the girls' baths.

00:20:03.140 --> 00:20:07.820
I hereby declare the debt for that crime to be paid by the sentence you have served.

00:20:08.570 --> 00:20:09.550
In other words...

00:20:10.370 --> 00:20:12.490
now, as of this moment,

00:20:12.730 --> 00:20:40.230
you are...

00:20:43.240 --> 00:20:44.290
free!

00:22:45.750 --> 00:22:50.030
And that is how the Underground Student
Council broke so many of the school's rules.

00:22:50.660 --> 00:22:55.200
Further, I have learned that there were acts of violence in the Chairman's Office.

00:22:55.860 --> 00:22:58.960
It is unclear what those were,
as the boy who had his arm broken

00:22:58.960 --> 00:23:00.830
is not seeking any punishment
for that offense,

00:23:00.830 --> 00:23:03.310
but after everything that
they have committed,

00:23:03.310 --> 00:23:07.080
there is no way that a mere in-dorm suspension is warranted.

00:23:07.080 --> 00:23:07.920
Mm-hmm.

00:23:07.920 --> 00:23:09.670
As I said earlier,

00:23:09.670 --> 00:23:13.600
letting them get away with anything less could be seen as leniency,

00:23:13.600 --> 00:23:17.180
given that the Underground Student Council president is the chairman's daughter.

00:23:17.510 --> 00:23:20.030
I am just a humble educator.

00:23:20.030 --> 00:23:21.910
Something like that will not happen...

00:23:21.910 --> 00:23:22.890
here!

00:23:22.890 --> 00:23:27.530
School rules are the law of the campus,
and there must not be any exceptions to the...

00:23:27.530 --> 00:23:28.270
law!

00:23:29.410 --> 00:23:32.810
Very well. I shall accept your claim!

00:23:33.300 --> 00:23:35.110
Well, of course.

00:23:35.110 --> 00:23:36.170
Unbelievable.

00:23:36.170 --> 00:23:37.700
Is it true those three are going to prison?

00:23:37.700 --> 00:23:39.580
How come? They were supposed to crack down on these things!

00:23:39.580 --> 00:23:41.630
I heard they did terrible things to the boys.

00:23:41.630 --> 00:23:43.580
I wanted to be like them. How disillusioning.

00:24:00.840 --> 00:24:02.390
Now, change...

00:24:03.640 --> 00:24:06.230
into those dingy prison uniforms.
